  "content": "<p data-pid=\"PTFZ3c9R\">让我二刷的百合小说还不少，因为最近在学日语，正好挑一些以前看过翻译的百合小说重温一下。</p><p data-pid=\"9tKEhktk\">首先是恋爱喜剧高手みかみてれん（恋人不行作者）的高糖荤菜百合：《将放言说女生之间不可能的女孩子，在百日之内彻底攻陷的百合故事》</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1288\" data-rawheight=\"878\" data-original-token=\"v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1288\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1288&#39; height=&#39;878&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1288\" data-rawheight=\"878\" data-original-token=\"v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1288\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-b7275f770ddab8e02403512a68d8fcc1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"SKrWMceo\">究竟有多荤呢？曾经一度阅读等级高到我签了那么多年到都看不了帖子的水平（</p><p data-pid=\"2QtT0eoh\">还好现在学日语了，直接原汁原味！（bushi</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"Sw0flsJJ\">还有近年来的百合大作《一周一次买下同班同学的那些事》，日语原文真是让两人的麻烦、拧巴感再上一层楼。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2128\" data-rawheight=\"1572\" data-original-token=\"v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2128\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2128&#39; height=&#39;1572&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2128\" data-rawheight=\"1572\" data-original-token=\"v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2128\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-4d303133733253afd435e0c0bc9aa8bc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"0WdH5x1j\">不过 U35 老师真的把仙台桑越画越怪了，宫城桑倒是越画娇了，感觉有点偏心了。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"vHZfT5WG\">新晋百合作家犬甘あんず的小说也值得细品啊！请桜木蓮来画插画更是绝配口牙！</p><p data-pid=\"-wUEUJSQ\">わんこ这本挺癫的，可惜两卷早早完结，不然我觉得妹妹和結愛都还能再展开写写。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"868\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"868\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;868&#39; height=&#39;796&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"868\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"868\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-9d6a0cde36f15585e16ba1b4ffa2118e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"8QR0WryR\">这本好きなこのいもうと就是三角+姐妹+代餐文学的属性大乱炖。互相扮演实属震撼美味了。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1280&#39; height=&#39;796&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1280\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1280\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-87a124126fdddbcb5ec1fc87a4756bcf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><hr/><p data-pid=\"zap5V3Z6\">最后，怎么能不重读日百小说的高山——《安达与岛村》——呢？被入间最近三部新作整得死去活来，还是回来看看他唯一的温柔吧（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1700\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1700\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1700&#39; height=&#39;796&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1700\" data-rawheight=\"796\" data-original-token=\"v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1700\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6a3fee62be43b96d84ce7759e1bebd83_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><hr/><p data-pid=\"fkj9EW52\">还有一些百合小说有重读的计划，但目前想读的堆积太多，暂时还没开始的：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"816\" data-rawheight=\"744\" data-original-token=\"v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"816\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;816&#39; height=&#39;744&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"816\" data-rawheight=\"744\" data-original-token=\"v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"816\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4dedf94d10da3386bc8eac3e7c7e2a04_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"gbxuTn3E\">剧情简介：杀杀贴贴杀杀杀贴贴贴杀杀杀杀杀贴贴贴贴贴（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1188\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-original-token=\"v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1188\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1188&#39; height=&#39;780&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1188\" data-rawheight=\"780\" data-original-token=\"v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1188\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8f336e45545d23e3a1f46ef499e24de0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"-DHI9yDU\">剧情简介：梯形（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1188\" data-rawheight=\"760\" data-original-token=\"v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1188\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1188&#39; height=&#39;760&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1188\" data-rawheight=\"760\" data-original-token=\"v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1188\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-17b560622ca804833db2ea974c750b50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"3pAjQKYx\">剧情简介：佐伯女士保护协会（</p><hr/><h2>相关回答</h2><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/587418183/answer/2086092799628333533\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"姐妹们，帮忙推几部百合小说or写百合的作者！?\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-876fbd3be41497534c0db020af0c6b11.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">姐妹们，帮忙推几部百合小说or写百合的作者！?</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/409806588/answer/2085061463077605974\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"哪里可以看日语原文小说呢？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-37b2b999b1774e1ee82b4d1174edf851.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">哪里可以看日语原文小说呢？</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/590280670/answer/2058265266644054340\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"有什么好看的百合轻小说吗？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d447931e8ca2b56b55d26c3ad1720f48.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">有什么好看的百合轻小说吗？</a><p></p>",
